+**Report-only correction**:
+The Task's single opportunity to replace a missing or invalid WorkerReport without changing the delivered work. Its execution contributes no new Truth paths; another missing or invalid report blocks the Task.
+_Avoid_: code correction, caller-selected read-only mode
+
 **ReviewResult**:
 The structured verdict a Reviewer returns.
 _Avoid_: review comments, PR review
